$version Alwavelets register panel demo $end
$comment Synthetic RV32 retirements from two harts; not a CPU simulation. $end
$comment Open this file normally (without --demo), then press p. $end
$comment Try ;goto 6500ns, ;goto 7100ns, ;goto 7500ns, ;goto 7600ns. $end
$timescale 1ns $end
$scope module top $end
$var wire 1 ! clk $end
$var wire 1 " reset $end
$var wire 1 # valid_wb $end
$var wire 1 $ hart_id $end
$var wire 32 % instr_wb $end
$var wire 5 & rd_addr $end
$var wire 32 ' rd_data $end
$var wire 1 ( rd_wen $end
$scope module pc $end
$var wire 32 ) wb $end
$upscope $end
$upscope $end
$enddefinitions $end
